{"1849900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Among Us 3D: VR", "steam_appid": 1849900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The definitive social deduction party game in three dimensions! <i>Among Us 3D </i>is a party game of teamwork and betrayal. Grab your crew of 4-10 players and launch into a fully 3D version of the beloved classic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: </strong><i>Among Us 3D: VR </i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.poster.avif?t=1775581026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.webm?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.mp4?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the core <i>Among Us</i> gameplay you know and love, such as tasks, sabotages, Emergency Meetings, and venting — now in 3D!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Classic gameplay, play as either Crewmate or Impostor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— <strong>Crewmate Mission</strong>: Complete all tasks or eject the Impostor. Keep your eyes and ears open — someone could be lurking right around the corner. Can you and the crew survive?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— <strong>Impostor Mission</strong>: Sabotage, deceive, and kill all Crewmates! Sneak through vents, craft the perfect lie, frame the innocent, and survive at any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.poster.avif?t=1775581026\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.webm?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.mp4?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy classic Crewmate tasks, reimagined with innovative and immersive first-person controls. Beware the Impostor while you try your hand at all new tasks! Customize your gameplay, comfort, and safety settings to build the best experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch things up with Roles, Tag Mode, and Custom Lobbies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add even more Roles into the mix with fan-favorites like the vent-using Engineer from the original <i>Among Us</i> or some <i>AU3D </i>exclusives, such as the vengeful Wraith or justice-seeking Vigilante! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tag Mode, it’s Infected versus Crewmates. The Infectedtry to catch and infect all Crewmates to expand their ranks before the Crewmates can finish a set number of tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/73821d9a98717cff5fccdaf3ffaef42f.poster.avif?t=1775581026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/73821d9a98717cff5fccdaf3ffaef42f.webm?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/73821d9a98717cff5fccdaf3ffaef42f.mp4?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lobby up and connect with other Crewmates — including <i>Among Us 3D</i> PC players! — with native crossplay. Create custom lobbies for you and your closest pals with personalized gameplay, comfort, and moderation settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong><i>Among Us 3D: VR</i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/294e77bf09d586b52cb9757dcfe9ec7e.poster.avif?t=1775581026\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/294e77bf09d586b52cb9757dcfe9ec7e.webm?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/294e77bf09d586b52cb9757dcfe9ec7e.mp4?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion your Crewmate with an endless number of color, hat, glove, and skin combinations. Expand your wardrobe even more with Stardust. Purchase this in-game currency* to spend on additional cosmetics and let your true style shine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong>: Stardust is not compatible with and cannot be converted to or from currencies in the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/bcffa5f0ee76f05b245fe4e18a7d50d4.poster.avif?t=1775581026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/bcffa5f0ee76f05b245fe4e18a7d50d4.webm?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/bcffa5f0ee76f05b245fe4e18a7d50d4.mp4?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with or betray your friends using your preferred method of communication:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Yap away with native, proximity voice chat.<br>— Setup private lobbies with your friends without needing external chatting apps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Not a talker? Use intuitive and efficient Quick Text Chat options to stay communicative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Express yourself through your hands with the all-new Gesture system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The definitive social deduction party game in three dimensions! <i>Among Us 3D </i>is a party game of teamwork and betrayal. Grab your crew of 4-10 players and launch into a fully 3D version of the beloved classic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: </strong><i>Among Us 3D: VR </i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.poster.avif?t=1775581026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.webm?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.mp4?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the core <i>Among Us</i> gameplay you know and love, such as tasks, sabotages, Emergency Meetings, and venting — now in 3D!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Classic gameplay, play as either Crewmate or Impostor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— <strong>Crewmate Mission</strong>: Complete all tasks or eject the Impostor. Keep your eyes and ears open — someone could be lurking right around the corner. Can you and the crew survive?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— <strong>Impostor Mission</strong>: Sabotage, deceive, and kill all Crewmates! Sneak through vents, craft the perfect lie, frame the innocent, and survive at any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.poster.avif?t=1775581026\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.webm?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.mp4?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy classic Crewmate tasks, reimagined with innovative and immersive first-person controls. Beware the Impostor while you try your hand at all new tasks! Customize your gameplay, comfort, and safety settings to build the best experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch things up with Roles, Tag Mode, and Custom Lobbies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add even more Roles into the mix with fan-favorites like the vent-using Engineer from the original <i>Among Us</i> or some <i>AU3D </i>exclusives, such as the vengeful Wraith or justice-seeking Vigilante! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tag Mode, it’s Infected versus Crewmates. The Infectedtry to catch and infect all Crewmates to expand their ranks before the Crewmates can finish a set number of tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/73821d9a98717cff5fccdaf3ffaef42f.poster.avif?t=1775581026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/73821d9a98717cff5fccdaf3ffaef42f.webm?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/73821d9a98717cff5fccdaf3ffaef42f.mp4?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lobby up and connect with other Crewmates — including <i>Among Us 3D</i> PC players! — with native crossplay. Create custom lobbies for you and your closest pals with personalized gameplay, comfort, and moderation settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong><i>Among Us 3D: VR</i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/294e77bf09d586b52cb9757dcfe9ec7e.poster.avif?t=1775581026\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/294e77bf09d586b52cb9757dcfe9ec7e.webm?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/294e77bf09d586b52cb9757dcfe9ec7e.mp4?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion your Crewmate with an endless number of color, hat, glove, and skin combinations. Expand your wardrobe even more with Stardust. Purchase this in-game currency* to spend on additional cosmetics and let your true style shine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong>: Stardust is not compatible with and cannot be converted to or from currencies in the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/bcffa5f0ee76f05b245fe4e18a7d50d4.poster.avif?t=1775581026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/bcffa5f0ee76f05b245fe4e18a7d50d4.webm?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/bcffa5f0ee76f05b245fe4e18a7d50d4.mp4?t=1775581026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with or betray your friends using your preferred method of communication:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Yap away with native, proximity voice chat.<br>— Setup private lobbies with your friends without needing external chatting apps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Not a talker? Use intuitive and efficient Quick Text Chat options to stay communicative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Express yourself through your hands with the all-new Gesture system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The definitive social deduction party game in virtual reality! Can the Crewmates survive, or will Impostors take over? Roles, Emergency Meetings, deception, sabotages, tasks: enjoy your favorite brand of chaos from the original Among Us with a VR twist.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese", "reviews": "“This is easily one of the best VR adaptations of an existing game yet.”<br>9/10 – IGN<br><br>“Undoubtedly, VR makes Among Us 10 times better than the original!”<br>9.2/10 – Lords of Gaming<br><br>“Among Us [3D]: VR is a great execution of an extremely popular game - and genre - of recent years.”<br>8.5/10 – Dual Shockers<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/748bb45cd8c76fa5c7b2b0ff08154c7553082cde/header.jpg?t=1775581026", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/8cfeddbb0e0b4a492de7c0f4e52a47ff29c458de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775581026", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/8cfeddbb0e0b4a492de7c0f4e52a47ff29c458de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775581026", "website": "http://amongus3D.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR or Oculus PC</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 6700 / AMD Ryzen 3600 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 480 or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2015-2024, Innersloth LLC. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Schell Games", "Innersloth", "Robot Teddy"], "publishers": ["Innersloth"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [1295382, 1105753], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Among Us 3D: VR", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1295382, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Among Us 3D: VR - $9.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 999}, {"packageid": 1105753, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Among Us 3D: VR - Commercial License - $19.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 1999}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "metacritic": {"score": 82, "url": "https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/among-us-vr?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 27, "description": "Cross-Platform Multiplayer"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 52, "description": "Tracked Controller Support"}